n't performed  in 15 years and the band has not met him  yet matthew mcconaughey rhys witherspoon  scarlett johansson taryn edgerton tori  kelly and nick kroll returned to voice  their beloved characters in the sequel  to the 2016 film and the added star  voices for the sequel include halsey  pharrell williams eric andre and u2's  bono as clay callaway alright that's it  for this week but before you go why not  drop down in the comments and let us  know what you'll be watching this week  i'm kale and i'll see you next time  [Music]

